=Generate a professional HTML newsletter for the following:

Category: {{ $json.category }}

Articles:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.articles) }}

Images:
- Hero Image URL: {{ $json.images.hero.url }}
- Section 1 Image URL: {{ $json.images.section1.url }}
- Section 2 Image URL: {{ $json.images.section2.url }}

Email recipient: {{ $json.email }}

Instructions:
- Use ALL articles provided
- Embed the hero image at the top
- Embed section images between article groups
- Highlight the most important trend you see across articles
- Include publication date for each article
- Include source name for each article
- Make it visually stunning and professional

